Package: threesf
Type: Package
Title: Lightweight 3D Vector Measures (Area, Volume, Length, Distance)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Insang", "Song", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "geoissong@gmail.com")
Description: Header-only C++17 implementation of PostGIS/SFCGAL-style 3D
    functions (ST_3DArea, ST_Volume, ST_3DLength, ST_3DDistance, ST_Tesselate,
    ST_Extrude, ...) with full Simple Features Z WKT/WKB (and EWKT/EWKB) I/O,
    exposed to R through .Call. Suggests sf for interop.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices
Suggests: sf, testthat (>= 3.0.0), plotly
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/sigmafelix/threesf
BugReports: https://github.com/sigmafelix/threesf/issues
